{"sourceUrl":"https://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/info/1044/8482.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:28.731209+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/info/1044/8482.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为深化青年学子对公共外交、国家安全领域前沿动态的理解，促进全国高校优秀学生学术交流，吸引有志于相关学科研究的优秀本科生攻读硕士学位，吉林大学公共外交学院、国家发展与安全研究院拟举办</span><span>“2025年校园学术活动开放日”</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、申请</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法、身心健康、品德优良，在校期间未受过纪律处分；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.全国各高校202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年全日制本科应届毕业生；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>已获得或即将获得所读大学免试推荐研究生资格</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较好的专业素养、较强的创新意识和创新能力；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.外语水平须符合以下任意一项：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）全国大学英语四级或六级考试成绩达到425分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）托福（TOEFL）考试成绩达到90分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）雅思（IELTS）考试成绩达到6分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）GRE成绩达到300分及以上（新）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5）英语专业四级或八级考试成绩60分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>6）WSK（PETS-5）考试成绩60分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>7）通过俄语专业四级考试或全国大学俄语四级（CRT4）或俄罗斯联邦对外俄语等级考试</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>ТРКИ</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>B1及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>8）通过日语专业四级考试或全国大学日语四级（CJT4）或日语能力测试（JLPT）N2及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>9）在国外有1年以上（含1年）全日制学习经历（报考英语、日语、俄语语种为当地主要日常用语和授课语言）的人员，该部分人员</span></span><span><span>须</span></span><span><span>提供学习经历证明和成绩单。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>公共外交学院：外交学</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>国家发展与安全研究院：国家安全学</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、日程安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>本</span></span><span><span>次</span></span><span><span>校园学术活动开放日</span></span><span><span>拟</span></span><span><span>于</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月初</span></span><span><span>举行</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>具体时间</span></span><span><span>和形式</span></span><span><span>另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、申报方法</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.网上报名</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>通过</span><span>“校园学术活动开放日报名系统”（网址为https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn）报名。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.提交材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）《</span></span><span><span>吉林大学</span><span>2025年校园学术活动开放日报名表</span></span><span><span>》</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>报名系统内导出</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）个人简历1份，无格式要求；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>有效第二代居民身份证（正反面在同一页）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）学生证（包含个人照片页、学校盖章的信息页及注册页，合并在同一页）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）个人成绩单，需加盖教务部门公章；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>）由教务部门或所在院系开具的成绩排名（详见附件</span><span>1），需加盖教务部门或所在院系公章；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>各专业</span></span><span><span>所涉及的学术论文</span><span>1篇（具体要求详见附件2</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><strong><span><span>需单独提交</span><span>PDF版</span></span></strong><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>）外语水平证明；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>）其它获奖证明、公开发表的学术文章等佐证材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>以上材料（</span><span>1）-（</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>）项，请扫描形成一个完整的</span><span>PDF文档，文档名命名为“申请专业+本科学校+申请人姓</span></span><span><span>名</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>校园学术活动开放日</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>第（</span><span>7）项PDF文档单独命名为</span></span><span><span>“申请专业+本科学校+申请人姓</span></span><span><span>名</span></span><span><span>+论文题目”，以上两个PDF文档放到一个压缩包中，</span></span><span><span>发送电子版至</span><span>sipayjs@jlu.edu.cn（</span></span><span><span>压缩包</span></span><span><span>及邮件题目均命名为</span><span>“申请专业+本科学校+申请人姓</span></span><span><span>名</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>校园学术活动开放日</span><span>”） 。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名及材料接收的截止时间为</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>16:00</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、其他事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>根据申请者的学业水平、科研能力等进行资格审查，</span></span><span><span>入围学员</span></span><span><span>名单于</span><span>8月</span></span><span><span>底</span></span><span><span>在官网公布（公共外交学院：</span><span>http://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/；国家发展与安全研究院：http://indss.jlu.edu.cn/）。未</span></span><span><span>入围</span></span><span><span>的同学，不再另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>在本次校园学术活动开放日活动中学术能力考核合格，并具备所在学校</span><span>2026年硕士研究生“推荐免试资格”的学生，考核成绩可以作为推免阶段的重要参考依据。</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：王老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系方式：</span><span>0431-85167204 13596195065</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>sipayjs@jlu.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>官网：</span><span>http://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/（公共外交学院）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>http://indss.jlu.edu.cn/（国家发展与安全研究院）</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>吉林大学公共外交学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>吉林大学国家发展与安全研究院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月7</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"b8979dff7db3fa27c53cea3706e33cd85fc4d57fc4add3900e13fdc54ff04803","textLength":1552,"sourceSha256":"bc08dd09df7e50a07203fd90619a49af339a6f1c1761af4e6379b58a52f39876","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1：成绩排名证明.docx","url":"https://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1550411868&wbfileid=16632152"},{"name":"附件2.吉林大学公共外交学院、国家发展与安全研究院“2025年校园学术活动开放日”学术论文要求.doc","url":"https://sipa.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1550411868&wbfileid=16632153"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-69c4c0fa9d741ad13eaa","title":"2025年吉林大学公共外交学院、国家发展与安全研究院“2025年校园学术活动开放日”通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:28.731209+00:00"}
